meta {
  name: 01 Quote seats
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/centers/me/subscription/quote
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "seats": 10
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 201
  res.body.seats: eq 10
  res.body.unitPriceXaf: eq 4500
}

docs {
  What N Start seats would cost **now**. Run `Center Auth / 03 Login` first.

  Body: `{"seats": 10}` — a **total**, not an increment. `unitPriceXaf` is HT;
  `totalXaf` is **TTC due now**. First purchase: full pack (e.g. 53,100 for 10).
  Mid-period addition: day prorata on the delta — see `Center Payments Prorata`.

  Also: `billableSeats`, `billingKind`, `amountHtXaf`, and when mid-period
  `daysLeft` / `daysInPeriod`.

  Minimum contract: 10 seats. Below → 400 SEATS_BELOW_MINIMUM.

  THE PRICE IS NOT AN INPUT. Extra fields → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.

  Works while BLOCKED and with an unfinished profile — paying starts with a
  quote. `02 Create payment` still refuses an incomplete profile.
}
